    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Curse Crackers</i></strong> is a fast-paced acrobatic platformer where you bounce, vault, and fight your way through the whimsical world of Ledamra with the help of your loyal companion Chime. Eat snacks, collect items, and travel the world to stop Bonnie and her band of troublemakers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>PLAY</i></strong> through worlds as Belle with the help of her companion Chime. Defeat a variety of enemies and avoid obstacles while you leap through each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>DISCOVER</i></strong> hidden secrets and collectibles hidden in every area. They might just come in handy later! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/d2effd0136f305d20203f814f7d96c2a.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/d2effd0136f305d20203f814f7d96c2a.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/d2effd0136f305d20203f814f7d96c2a.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>CHALLENGE</i></strong> tough bosses on your journey in order to advance to more areas. Each one has a unique set of skills that you have to adjust for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2cafb7a31c502d04604e414e39437e56.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2cafb7a31c502d04604e414e39437e56.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2cafb7a31c502d04604e414e39437e56.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>CONNECT</i></strong> with all kinds of colorful characters at every location. They might have tasks to perform, items to sell, or just a nice chat!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Curse Crackers</i></strong> is a fast-paced acrobatic platformer where you bounce, vault, and fight your way through the whimsical world of Ledamra with the help of your loyal companion Chime. Eat snacks, collect items, and travel the world to stop Bonnie and her band of troublemakers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>PLAY</i></strong> through worlds as Belle with the help of her companion Chime. Defeat a variety of enemies and avoid obstacles while you leap through each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>DISCOVER</i></strong> hidden secrets and collectibles hidden in every area. They might just come in handy later! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/d2effd0136f305d20203f814f7d96c2a.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/d2effd0136f305d20203f814f7d96c2a.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/d2effd0136f305d20203f814f7d96c2a.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>CHALLENGE</i></strong> tough bosses on your journey in order to advance to more areas. Each one has a unique set of skills that you have to adjust for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2cafb7a31c502d04604e414e39437e56.poster.avif?t=1750859710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2cafb7a31c502d04604e414e39437e56.webm?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2cafb7a31c502d04604e414e39437e56.mp4?t=1750859710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>CONNECT</i></strong> with all kinds of colorful characters at every location. They might have tasks to perform, items to sell, or just a nice chat!</p>",
